  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby authorised shall be carried out in strict accordance with the mitigation measures set out in the submitted outdoor lighting design impact assessment report (prepared by Sports Facility Planning & Design Limited, dated 04.08.2026). \r\rReason: In order to safeguard the residential amenities of neighbouring properties and protect wildlife from adverse light spill and disturbance.\r",
    "The floodlights hereby approved shall generally include the following mitigation measures outlined in the submitted preliminary roost assessment report (prepared by ProHort Limited, dated 14.09.2026).\r\rReason: In order to safeguard wildlife, including bats, and protect the ecological value and biodiversity of the site.",
    "The development to which this permission relates must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of the decision notice.\r\rReason: To comply with the provisions of S.51 of the Planning & Compulsory Purchase Act 2004.",
    "The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans:\r\rLocation Plan, dated 11.05.2026\rSite Plan, dated 30.09.2026\rExisting Floor Plan, rev: 01, dated 25.05.2026\rProposed Floor Plan Floodlights, dated 30.09.2026\rExisting & Proposed Elevations, dated 30.09.2026\rPlanning and Access Statement\rOutdoor Lighting Design Assessment, dated 04.08.2026 \rPreliminary Roost Assessment, ref: Q-PH-202608-244, dated 14.09.2026\r\rReason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper planning.",
    "The floodlights hereby approved shall only be used between the hours of 8:00 and 21:30 Monday to Sunday and Bank Holidays.\r\rReason: In order to safeguard the residential amenities of neighbouring properties."
  ],
